_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Unleash devastating player-controlled abilities!</strong>\u00a0\ud83c\udfaf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick off enemies with pinpoint snipers, unleash sweeping area blasts, and lay traps anywhere on the island to stop the jacks in their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/dd68d50019e4a030446cc13d15e66ad1.poster.avif?t=1773747666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/dd68d50019e4a030446cc13d15e66ad1.webm?t=1773747666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/dd68d50019e4a030446cc13d15e66ad1.mp4?t=1773747666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf44\u00a0<strong>Turbo-charge your Shrooms\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udf44</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Shroom evolves along a unique upgrade path, unlocking powerful passives and monstrous abilities. Then stack game-changing modifiers to push every build even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/3b283249515e46ee5d145ac211447767.poster.avif?t=1773747666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/3b283249515e46ee5d145ac211447767.webm?t=1773747666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/3b283249515e46ee5d145ac211447767.mp4?t=1773747666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32\u00a0<strong>End